### 주문 생성 (쿠폰만 적용)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/with-discount
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "couponId": 1,
  "pointAmount": null
}

